      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2706 - Ya'qub ibn Shu'ayb asked Abu Abdullah (as) about a person in the state of ihram taking a bath.\nImam (as) said: \"Yes, they may pour water over their head, but they should not scrub it.\""
        ]
